{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Water is always moving around our planet in a special pattern called the water cycle.","words":[[0,0.46],[0.53,0.67],[0.76,1.16],[1.23,1.54],[1.61,1.93],[2,2.14],[2.22,2.65],[2.72,2.81],[2.87,2.89],[2.95,3.4],[3.48,3.94],[4,4.3],[4.32,4.39],[4.46,4.83],[4.89,5.8]]},{"text":"The Sun warms oceans, lakes, and rivers.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.26,0.48],[0.56,0.93],[1.01,1.53],[1.59,1.93],[1.95,2.07],[2.14,2.97]]},{"text":"When water gets warm, it turns into water vapor and rises into the air.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.37,0.72],[0.78,1.02],[1.1,1.58],[1.87,2.02],[2.07,2.42],[2.48,2.72],[2.81,3.16],[3.24,3.73],[3.82,4.03],[4.12,4.61],[4.69,4.91],[4.98,5.07],[5.16,5.8]]},{"text":"This step is called evaporation.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.61],[0.69,0.79],[0.86,1.16],[1.22,2.51]]},{"text":"High in the sky, the water vapor cools and forms tiny droplets.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.36,0.45],[0.5,0.57],[0.63,1.16],[1.21,1.28],[1.35,1.7],[1.76,2.17],[2.25,2.72],[2.77,2.91],[3.02,3.45],[3.52,3.85],[3.91,4.97]]},{"text":"These tiny droplets gather together to make clouds.","words":[[0,0.33],[0.37,0.73],[0.79,1.39],[1.47,1.8],[1.87,2.3],[2.37,2.44],[2.52,2.74],[2.8,3.81]]},{"text":"When clouds get heavy, water falls back down as rain or snow.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.34,0.73],[0.79,0.96],[1.03,1.38],[1.43,1.78],[1.85,2.21],[2.28,2.51],[2.58,2.84],[2.9,3.01],[3.15,3.4],[3.46,3.56],[3.65,4.46]]},{"text":"This falling water is called precipitation.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.37,0.8],[0.87,1.22],[1.3,1.41],[1.47,1.76],[1.82,3.11]]},{"text":"Rain fills rivers and oceans again.","words":[[0,0.35],[0.43,0.76],[0.84,1.25],[1.31,1.43],[1.51,1.96],[2.02,2.74]]},{"text":"Then the Sun warms the water again, and the cycle starts all over.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.33,0.4],[0.48,0.8],[0.89,1.35],[1.41,1.47],[1.53,1.88],[1.95,2.46],[2.75,2.94],[2.98,3.05],[3.11,3.6],[3.65,4.16],[4.23,4.49],[4.57,5.39]]}]}